#: ../../../source/architecture.rst:79
msgid "**Simple:** A newcomer should be able to read ``src/esp32_hub/Esp32_HubUnit.cpp`` and follow the whole system in a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/architecture.rst:82
msgid "**Layered:** Motors only run, brake or stop. Servos only move to an angle. Pins are only inputs or outputs. Everything else is built on top."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/architecture.rst:85
msgid "**Configurable:** The touchscreen decides the chassis, the motor mapping and the limits. These are data in EEPROM, not code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/architecture.rst:88
msgid "**Safe by default:** If the chassis is not fully mapped, or the command link is silent, the motors stay stopped."
msgstr ""
